### ==============================================================================
### ORDER SERVICE (Port 8081)
### ==============================================================================

### 1. Create a new Order
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-1001",
  "items": [
    {
      "skuCode": "IPHONE-15-128GB",
      "price": 799.00,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "skuCode": "MACBOOK-AIR-M3",
      "price": 1299.00,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Fetch all Orders
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders

### 3. Fetch single Order by Order Number
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/ORD-A1B2C3D4


### ==============================================================================
### INVENTORY SERVICE (Port 8082)
### ==============================================================================

### 4. Create new Inventory item
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuCode": "IPHONE-15-128GB",
  "quantity": 100
}

### 5. Fetch all Inventory items
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/inventory

### 6. Check stock for specific SKU codes
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/inventory?skuCode=IPHONE-15-128GB&skuCode=MACBOOK-AIR-M3

### 7. Fetch single Inventory item by SKU code
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/inventory/IPHONE-15-128GB

### 8. Update stock quantity for SKU code
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/v1/inventory/IPHONE-15-128GB?quantity=150

### 9. Reserve stock for an Order
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/inventory/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuCode": "IPHONE-15-128GB",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 10. Delete Inventory item by SKU code
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/v1/inventory/IPHONE-15-128GB
